  <text>
    <body>
      <p source="#source-235-261"><seg source="#source-235-261">今宵夜はふけたり</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-261-287"><seg source="#source-261-287">闇夜の　天空高く</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-287-313"><seg source="#source-287-313">一陣の星座を見る</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-313-354"><seg source="#source-313-354">こは天に懸かる我十字架なり</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-354-374"><seg source="#source-354-374">この夜　魂は</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-374-412"><seg source="#source-374-395">単調なる鼓動に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-395-407"><rb>倦</rb><rt>う</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-407-412">み</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-412-447"><seg source="#source-412-447">七重の塁壁を超えて至り</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-447-470"><seg source="#source-447-470">そが前に静座し</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-470-491"><seg source="#source-470-491">礼讃し　祈祷す</seg></p>
    </body>
